    "# Qween Uncensored AI Server\n",
    "\n",
    "Self-hosted uncensored Qwen 2.5 14B on Google Colab (FREE)\n",
    "\n",
    "**What this does:**\n",
    "1. Installs llama.cpp (fast C++ inference engine)\n",
    "2. Downloads Qwen 2.5 14B uncensored model (~9GB)\n",
    "3. Starts an OpenAI-compatible API server\n",
    "4. Creates a Cloudflare Tunnel (public URL, works from any device)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Important:** Colab sessions disconnect after inactivity. Just reopen and click **Run All** to get a new URL (takes ~2 minutes)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
